## Game Objects

### Lego Characters
- Minifigure silhouette (side view): round head, cylindrical body, short limbs
- Team colors: player (cyan), AI (red) — **v1.4** adds user-selectable uniform colors for your team
- Collision: circular hitbox (`CHARACTER_RADIUS`)
- Player team 2–3 / AI team 2–3 (`squadSize`)
- **Kick-ready pose** (`LegoCharacter` `active`): lean + raised leg during player charging and AI wind-up, plus cyan active ring

### Ball
- Center kickoff placement
- Low friction → **rolls far** after being hit
- Momentum transfer on character kick (see physics below)
- **v1.4**: choose from 2–3 ball designs (same physics, SVG skin only)

### Goals
- Left/right side goal mouths (opening in the center of field walls)
- Goal counts when the ball crosses the goal line within the goal height

### Goalkeeper Bar (v1.1)
- **Horizontal bar inside the goal** instead of a Lego GK character
- **Ping-pong** between far post ↔ near post (sin / ping-pong)
- Collides with **ball only** (characters pass through)
- Ball deflects on hit + haptic / "SAVE!" feedback — **v1.5** adds save SFX

```
  far post
     │
     │  ═══════  ← GK bar (slides vertically)
     │
  near post
```

| Property | Value (draft) |
|----------|---------------|
| Bar length | ~75% of goal width ( **`barLengthRatio`** — preset-driven in v2) |
| Thickness | 12px (`GK_BAR_THICKNESS`) |
| Move period | same on both sides (**`barPeriodMs`** — preset-driven in v2; Normal ≈ 1100ms) |
| Bounce coefficient | 0.65 |
| Goal mouth height | **`goalHeightRatio`** of field height (preset-driven in v2; Normal = 0.38) |

