## Physics (Football Striker style)

### Character ↔ Ball (kick)
1. After charging, releasing flicks the character in the **aim direction**
2. On collision, character **nearly stops** (`CHAR_STOP_ON_KICK ≈ 8%`)
3. **1.75×** character speed transfers to the ball (`KICK_TRANSFER`)
4. Turn ends when the ball stops rolling across the field

### Friction
| Object | Friction | Feel |
|--------|----------|------|
| Character | high (`CHAR_FRICTION 0.91`) | stops quickly after flick |
| Ball | low (`BALL_FRICTION 0.982`) | rolls well after kick; extra slowdown at low speed |

### Character ↔ Character
- Weak bounce (0.35) — obstacle feel, minimal pinball

### Goalkeeper Bar ↔ Ball (v1.1)
- Bar = infinite mass, ball deflects only
- Last line of defense before goal line

---

## Turn Flow

1. **Player turn** — touch & hold → power charge + aim → release → flick
2. **Simulation** — character & ball physics until **ball stops** (characters may stop earlier)
3. **Goal check** — kickoff reset on score; first to 3 goals wins
4. **AI turn** — pick nearest AI → **`AI_FLICK_DELAY_MS` (600ms) wind-up** (kick-ready pose) → flick toward ball
5. Repeat 2–4

