## v2 — GK Difficulty, Special Shots & Field Themes

Match depth and visual variety. Builds on v1.3 power/aim, v1.1 GK bar, and v1.4 customization patterns (pickers + `AsyncStorage`).

### GK Difficulty Presets ✅

Symmetric **Easy / Normal / Hard** presets applied to **both goals** (same match conditions for player and AI).

| Lever | Easy | Normal | Hard |
|-------|------|--------|------|
| Bar period (`barPeriodMs`) | 1400 | 1100 | 800 |
| Bar length ratio (`barLengthRatio`) | 0.62 | 0.75 | 0.88 |
| Goal mouth height (`goalHeightRatio`) | 0.42 | 0.38 | 0.32 |

- `GK_BAR_THICKNESS` and `GK_BOUNCE` stay fixed unless playtesting says otherwise
- `goalWidth` (depth) unchanged — vertical opening is the gameplay lever
- Default: **Normal** (matches pre-v2 constants)

**UI & persistence**

- Segmented picker in **Settings** (`app/settings.tsx`) — **Match** card (`SegmentedToggle`), same style as language toggle
- `gkDifficulty: 'easy' | 'normal' | 'hard'` in `GamePreferences` → `loadPreferences` / `savePreferences`
- `SettingsContext` exposes `gkDifficulty` / `setGkDifficulty`
- Game reads saved pref on mount (`app/game.tsx` → `useSoccerEngine.startGame`) — no route param
- i18n: `settings.match`, `settings.gkDifficulty`, `settings.gkDifficultyOptions.*` in `en.json` / `ko.json`

**Implementation**

- Types + presets: `GkDifficulty`, `GkDifficultyProfile` → `src/constants/gkDifficulty.ts`
- Parameterized: `src/utils/gk.ts`, `src/utils/layout.ts` (`getGoalZone`), `src/utils/field.ts`, `src/utils/physics.ts`, `src/components/SideViewField.tsx` (`gkBarLength` prop), `src/hooks/useSoccerEngine.ts` (`gkProfile` on match state)
- `createGkBars(field, barLengthRatio)` · `getGkBarCenterY(..., barPeriodMs)` · `getGkBarRects(..., barPeriodMs)` · `stepPhysics(..., barPeriodMs)`

### Special Shots — Curve ✅

Optional **curve** on ball trajectory after a kick — layered on v1.3 hold-charge + aim (no pull-back).

**Trigger**

- Release while **aiming** with power ≥ `CURVE_MIN_POWER_RATIO` (0.68) and finger **above/below** character (|dy| ≥ 8px)
- **Vertical drag does not change flick aim** — aim stays toward ball unless drag is mostly horizontal (`|dx| > |dy| × 0.85`)
- Nudge finger up/down while holding horizontal aim to add curve without re-aiming

**Physics**

- On kick transfer (`resolveKick`), apply `CURVE_INITIAL_VY` bias + `curveAccelVy` for `CURVE_DURATION_MS`
- Per-step lateral accel in `applyBallCurve` (deltaMs-scaled)
- `Character.curveDirection` set on flick, cleared on kick or turn end
- AI: `computeAiFlick` — 난이도별 확률 커브 (Easy 0% / Normal 22% / Hard 45%), GK 막대 반대 여유 공간 방향

**Feedback**

- Quadratic arc hint on `PowerGauge` when curve-eligible (pink); faint preview when power building
- Pink **trail** + glow ring on ball while curving; HUD shows **CURVE!** on contact
- `curve` feedback event reuses `super` SFX at 75% volume
- Haptic: `Rigid` on curve kick (at ball contact)

**UI**

- **No Settings control** — curve is learned gameplay (power + aim), not a toggle

**Implementation**

- Constants: `CURVE_AIM_MIN_DY`, `CURVE_INITIAL_VY`, `CURVE_DURATION_MS`, `CURVE_FORCE` → `src/constants/game.ts`
- Eligibility: `computeCurveDirection`, `isCurveShotEligible` → `src/utils/power.ts`
- Physics: `resolveKick` curve transfer, `applyBallCurve`, `events.curved` → `src/utils/physics.ts`
- Engine: `curveDirection` on flick, `deltaMs` to `stepPhysics` → `src/hooks/useSoccerEngine.ts`
- UI: `PowerGauge` curve arc + i18n `game.curve` → `src/components/PowerGauge.tsx`
- Feedback: `curve` event → `src/contexts/GameFeedbackContext.tsx`

